[[61,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the grille (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003485.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[61,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the nut (1a) and remove the trim (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003486.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[61,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the trim (1a), fitting the pins (1b) in the openings (1c) in the grille.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003487.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[61,7,0,"<p>Tighten the trim fixing nut.</p><p>Fit the grille and tighten the bolts.</p>"],[30,1,262144,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Turn the ignition key to the OFF position.</p><p>Lift the bonnet</p><p><a href=\"#/223000210\">Op. 7055B08 GRILLE (ONE) ON FRONT BUMPER - R.R</a></p><p>1. Undo the fixing nut and remove the badge from the grille.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003488.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[30,1,262144,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the badge is not damaged.</p><p>1. Fit the badge (1a) fitting the pins (1b) in the openings (1c) in the grille.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003489.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[30,1,262144,"<p>Tighten the badge fixing nut.</p><p><a href=\"#/223000210\">Op. 7055B08 GRILLE (ONE) ON FRONT BUMPER - R.R</a></p>"]]